stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> SnapshotTriggered: triggerSnapshot()
    SnapshotTriggered --> EventEmitted: YieldSnapshot emitted
    EventEmitted --> RSCProcessing: Reactive Network detects
    RSCProcessing --> AllocationCalculated: APY comparison
    AllocationCalculated --> CallbackSent: emit Callback
    CallbackSent --> RebalanceExecuted: executeRebalance()
    RebalanceExecuted --> Idle: Complete
